{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","chunk_index":2,"job_id":"mwjob_dfe2e471ead95adc895c5484","precondition_digest":"c5d6cf222be6ad3fb61ec35bf2651efa7d3705de7dd2dc6e398e812469cbabc3","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v2","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cc81ab6b8717128e","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s3_title","span_project_primary_objective","span_project_primary_endpoint","span_project_secondary_objective","span_project_key_secondary","span_project_other_secondary","span_project_safety_endpoint"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"研究目的和终点","proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的III期确证性临床研究，目标人群为成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。主要研究目的是评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。次要研究目的是评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响，关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例，以及第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例；其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。探索性目的和探索性终点见相应章节。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的主要目的、主要终点、次要目的、关键次要终点、其他次要终点和安全性终点撰写；需医学作者核实探索性分析是否需另述及终点层级表述。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cc81ab6b8717128e","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s31_text","span_project_primary_objective","span_project_primary_endpoint","span_project_estimand","span_project_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","proposal_text":"主要研究目的是评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。该终点基于治疗策略人群进行比较，治疗策略人群为所有随机受试者；停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，其他缺失数据采用无应答填补，并报告组间率差及95%置信区间。主要分析以优效性为目标，全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较第16周PASI 75应答，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的主要目的、主要终点、估计目标策略和统计分析策略撰写；需医学作者核实主要分析细节与统计章节的一致性。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["涉及主要终点、估计目标、样本量、剂量、对照、人群或随机盲法等高影响设计，请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s33_empty","span_project_secondary_objective"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","proposal_text":"探索性分析用于补充描述合成试验药A在成人中重度斑块状银屑病受试者中的疗效与安全性特征，并用于评价疾病相关指标在治疗过程中的变化趋势。探索性目的不涉及确证性假设检验，其分析结果不用于支持主要终点或关键次要终点的优效性结论。探索性分析仅基于本研究已收集的疗效、安全性及疾病相关指标进行描述性评价，并与主要分析、关键次要分析相互区分。探索性分析结果用于支持对研究药物获益与风险的总体理解，并作为后续研究假设生成的参考。","rationale":"研究定义未列出具体的探索性目的和探索性终点，本段仅说明探索性分析与确证性分析的边界，不设定未经确认的指标；需医学作者确认是否补充探索性分析及相应终点。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s4_empty","span_project_design","span_project_population","span_project_inclusion","span_project_randomization","span_project_control_1to1","span_project_intervention","span_project_periods","span_project_visits","span_project_no_interim"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":9},"heading":"研究设计","proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的III期确证性临床研究，采用平行组、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、多中心设计。目标人群为年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月、筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3且适合接受系统治疗或光疗的成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者。符合条件的受试者按1:1随机分配至合成试验药A组或匹配安慰剂组。试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。双盲治疗期为16周，筛选期最长4周，安全性随访期4周。筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。本研究不开展期中分析。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的总体设计、目标人群、入选标准、随机分配、1:1分组、试验干预、研究时期和访视策略撰写；需医学作者核实访视时间窗、中心安排及入选标准的完整表述。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s41_text","span_project_design","span_project_control_1to1","span_project_intervention","span_project_periods","span_project_visits","span_project_primary_endpoint"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"总体设计","proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计。试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周；试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，第1天至第16周，对照组接受匹配安慰剂。研究分为筛选期、双盲治疗期和安全性随访期，筛选期最长4周，双盲治疗期16周，安全性随访期4周。筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。主要疗效评价在第16周进行，以第16周PASI 75应答作为主要终点。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的总体设计、1:1随机、双盲治疗16周、试验干预、研究时期和访视策略撰写；需医学作者核实设计表述与统计章节的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s421_empty","span_project_sample_size","span_project_estimand","span_project_stats","span_project_no_interim","span_project_primary_endpoint"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"确证性设计与假设依据","proposal_text":"本研究为确证性研究，采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计，以优效性为目标评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。主要假设为：第16周PASI 75应答率在试验组高于安慰剂组。样本量估计假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。主要分析采用全分析集按随机分组通过CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。本研究不开展期中分析。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的确证性研究目的、样本量假设、优效性目标、CMH分析、缺失处理和期中分析安排撰写；需医学作者核实假设参数和统计方法。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s43_text","span_project_randomization","span_project_control_1to1","span_project_parallel","span_project_visits","span_project_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"heading":"随机化","proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，符合条件的受试者按1:1随机分配至合成试验药A组或匹配安慰剂组。随机化在筛选后于基线/第1天进行，随机分组与平行组设计相结合，使每位受试者仅接受一种治疗方案，并支持组间可比性。随机分配用于减少选择偏倚，随机分组也是全分析集分析的基础，全分析集按随机分组进行主要终点比较。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的随机分配、1:1随机、平行组、基线/第1天随机和全分析集分析撰写；需医学作者核实随机化技术实现和分配隐藏安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["涉及主要终点、估计目标、样本量、剂量、对照、人群或随机盲法等高影响设计，请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921150940_d1988470","evidence_span_ids":["span_pfd_s44_text","span_project_design","span_project_no_interim","span_corpus_unblinding_record"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"盲法与揭盲","proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计，受试者和研究者对治疗分组保持盲态，匹配安慰剂用于维持盲法。双盲治疗期持续16周，主要疗效终点在第16周评价，以减少观察偏倚。本研究不开展期中分析，因此不涉及因期中分析而实施的揭盲。若因受试者安全或监管要求确需获知治疗分组，应按照预先规定的程序进行紧急揭盲，并完整记录揭盲原因、时间及相关处理情况。","rationale":"依据研究定义中的双盲设计和不开展期中分析，以及通用方案中关于紧急揭盲记录要求的表述撰写；需医学作者核实盲态角色、揭盲程序及揭盲后处理。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["涉及主要终点、估计目标、样本量、剂量、对照、人群或随机盲法等高影响设计，请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:cd3a4b7d18f2ee8911d81eb8","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"37ca21cb154bef6e88ff357d1796c58412125030376ce377f8ec69e6524e1e07"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"8daf6dc46d42155e29ca2768fe326bcf20208390c0e565062d237a9768f12e59"},{"locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b11c26ea0"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:356|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9dcf0050e6908f1bf1781d1b4e78bece680543f7bd3b6d430526c8fa0873ec33"},{"locator":"section:个例紧急揭盲|block:471|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b1d5885b4afe4e5db3e8caef9a6db54129aefdb157084e23f8cc6b089099b16a"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"561c757e6967fae66f0f9d1043dba3e313bd0ee60a03f2c3c8da5efe892b0128"}]}